 methanol"},"hi":{"content":"निम्नलिखित यौगिकों को C–OH बंधन की लंबाई के बढ़ते क्रम में व्यवस्थित करें : <br>मेथेनॉल, फिनॉल,\np-एथॉक्सीफिनॉल","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"फिनॉल &lt; मेथेनॉल &lt; p-एथॉक्सीफिनॉल"},{"identifier":"B","content":"मेथेनॉल &lt; p-एथॉक्सीफिनॉल &lt; फिनॉल"},{"identifier":"C","content":"मेथेनॉल &lt; फिनॉल &lt; p-एथॉक्सीफिनॉल"},{"identifier":"D","content":"फिनॉल &lt; p-एथॉक्सीफिनॉल &lt; मेथेनॉल"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"3G6dabpylT237sDCoJ7k9k2k5h0ozpj","updated_time":1581045911,"permalink":"arrange-the-following-compounds-in-increasing-order-of-coh-jee-main-chemistry-alcohols-phenols-and-ethers-f2dmaunds80kvfjr","timeAllotted":144000,"paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-8th-january-morning-slot","topic":"properties-preparation-and-uses-of-phenols","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["sequence_ordering"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-8th-january-morning-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","chapter":"coordination-compounds","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 8th January Morning Slot","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"medium","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-01-08 09:30","question":{"en":{"content":"The complex that can show fac- and mer-isomers is :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"[CoCl<sub>2</sub>(en)<sub>2</sub>]"},{"identifier":"B","content":"[Pt(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>Cl<sub>2</sub>]"},{"identifier":"C","content":"[Co(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>(NO<sub>2</sub>)<sub>3</sub>]"},{"identifier":"D","content":"[Co(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>Cl<sub>2</sub>]<sup>+</sup>"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"[Ma<sub>3</sub>b<sub>3</sub>] type complex shows fac and mer\nisomerism.\n<br><br>So [Co(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>(NO<sub>2</sub>)<sub>3</sub>]